;;
;; creeperdiamonds.xyz — the one record the personal site needs
;;
;; Import in Cloudflare: DNS > Records > Import and Export > Import DNS records.
;; Or just add it by hand; it is a single record and the importer needs a file
;; upload, which is the harder path on a phone.
;;
;; SET PROXY STATUS TO "DNS ONLY" (grey cloud).
;; Cloud Run issues and renews its own certificate by reaching this record. A
;; proxied record puts Cloudflare's certificate in front of that process and
;; the mapping never validates — CertificateProvisioned stays Unknown forever
;; with nothing saying why. The existing `appealy` CNAME is DNS-only for the
;; same reason; copy its settings.
;;
;; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
;; DO NOT POINT THE BARE APEX AT CLOUD RUN.
;;
;; creeperdiamonds.xyz is a Minecraft server address and was one first:
;;
;;   creeperdiamonds.xyz          CNAME  ...shield.neoprotect.ovh
;;   _minecraft._tcp              SRV    0 5 25565 ...shield.neoprotect.ovh
;;
;; Port 25565 answers on it today. DNS resolves a name to one set of
;; addresses and Cloud Run's do not speak Minecraft, so moving the apex here
;; would trade a working server address for a working web page. Java clients
;; that use the SRV record would survive it; anyone who saved the address
;; WITH the port, and every Bedrock client, would not.
;;
;; An earlier version of this file told you to delete six A records at the
;; apex. Those records do not exist. The 82.22.5.x addresses are what
;; Cloudflare's CNAME flattening returns for the NeoProtect target, and the
;; only A records in the zone belong to mee6 and priority — both unrelated
;; subdomains. Deleting by IP would have found nothing; deleting the apex
;; CNAME would have taken the Minecraft server down.
;; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
;;
;; Issued by:
;;   gcloud beta run domain-mappings create --service=appealy \
;;     --domain=www.creeperdiamonds.xyz --region=us-central1 \
;;     --project=yahav-project-505809
;;
;; TTL 1 is Cloudflare's "Auto".
;;

www.creeperdiamonds.xyz.	1	IN	CNAME	ghs.googlehosted.com.
